  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="11dde5e5-278b-4d9f-8b08-b197c7eef718"><problem><para>
      <para><emphasis>Select three</emphasis> expressions that are perfect squares.</para>
      </para></problem><solution><para>["\\((x+5)(x+5)\\)", "\\((-9+c)(c-9)\\)", "\\((a+b)(b+a)\\)"]</para><para>
      <para>The correct answers are: \((x+5)(x+5), (-9+c)(c−9), (a+b)(b+a)\). </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
</document>
